  "body": "Automatic declassification of records older than 20 years with narrow exceptions.",
  "integration_note": "Privacy and transparency follow a maturity-based transition: Codex Solbian guidelines apply until full project maturity, then Codex Minsoo guidelines apply with adapted Solbian principles. During development phase, Solbian's privacy protection and minimum disclosure principles take precedence.",
